        <div data-reveal="up" class="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" data-faq="open" class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">Do I need a visa for my trip?</span><span class="faq-icon is-open"><svg viewbox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="faq-icon-svg">
                  <path d="M7 1.5v11M1.5 7h11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                </svg></span></button>
            <div class="faq-answer is-open">
              <div class="faq-answer-inner is-open">
                <p class="faq-answer-text">It depends on your passport and destination. Once you book, we check the entry rules for every country on your itinerary and guide you through any visa paperwork step by step.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" data-faq="question" class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">What happens if my flight is cancelled or delayed?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg viewbox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="faq-icon-svg">
                  <path d="M7 1.5v11M1.5 7h11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                </svg></span></button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                <p class="faq-answer-text">Our team monitors every booking around the clock. If plans change, we rebook your flights, hotels and transfers for you at no extra planning fee.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" data-faq="question" class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">Can I customise a package tour?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg viewbox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="faq-icon-svg">
                  <path d="M7 1.5v11M1.5 7h11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                </svg></span></button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                <p class="faq-answer-text">Absolutely. Every package is a starting point: swap hotels, add nights or include private experiences, and we will update the price before you confirm.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" data-faq="question" class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">Is travel insurance included?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg viewbox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="faq-icon-svg">
                  <path d="M7 1.5v11M1.5 7h11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                </svg></span></button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                <p class="faq-answer-text">Comprehensive travel insurance is included on all international packages, covering medical care, cancellations and lost luggage. You can upgrade your cover at any time.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" data-faq="question" class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">How far in advance should I book?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg viewbox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="faq-icon-svg">
                  <path d="M7 1.5v11M1.5 7h11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                </svg></span></button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                <p class="faq-answer-text">For peak seasons we recommend booking three to six months ahead. Last-minute trips are possible too; just ask and we will confirm availability within 24 hours.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" data-faq="question" class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">Do you plan trips for families and groups?</span><span class="faq-icon"><svg viewbox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="faq-icon-svg">
                  <path d="M7 1.5v11M1.5 7h11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                </svg></span></button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                <p class="faq-answer-text">Yes. We arrange family-friendly stays, connecting rooms and group transfers, and one dedicated planner looks after every detail from first quote to return flight.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
